{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roulette Hero combines the mechanics of Luck Be A Landlord and Slay the Spire, and is a brand new form of deck-building roguelite strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull the lever, spin the roulette and trigger some killer combos! Each pull of the lever is full of surprises. Will you start a chain reaction, deal crushingly high damage, demolish your enemy and come out on top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/edf8dac0b5daf29407078fe5a2b08ad6.poster.avif?t=1772681037\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/edf8dac0b5daf29407078fe5a2b08ad6.webm?t=1772681037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/edf8dac0b5daf29407078fe5a2b08ad6.mp4?t=1772681037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft the Ultimate Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream team of extraordinary animal companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position them wisely and combine their abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating combos to wipe out the battlefield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Spin is a New Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple player character and swappable levers, all with unique special abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 animal types, 100+ animal tiles to arrange on your board</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ power-up cartridges to mix and match</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each spin could turn the tide... or send you scrambling for a comeback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_